{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Hey Andrew, hope you're doing ok. I recently had a good week - I went to a pet store last Monday to buy toys for my dogs and it was great seeing them so excited when I got them home. It made me realize how much I love them and how much joy they bring me."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-ab46e430c758bf24fbd3a8df", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.067930+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ab46e430c758bf24fbd3a8df", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ab46e430c758bf24fbd3a8df", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Hi Audrey! Pets really can make our lives better, huh? Speaking of which, I've got some awesome news -- I recently adopted another pup from a shelter. He's the best."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-4d5af5c404a9566e4614824a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.092021+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4d5af5c404a9566e4614824a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4d5af5c404a9566e4614824a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Wow! That's awesome news! How's he doing in his new home?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-51b7a41350afd43dd9a3c4b4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.104879+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "51b7a41350afd43dd9a3c4b4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "51b7a41350afd43dd9a3c4b4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Thanks! He's doing great in his new home. Still getting used to Toby and the new environment. Toby needs some time to get along with him too. I never imagined having pets would bring so much happiness. Pets really bring lots of joy and companionship to our lives."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-3584d72be01a8c606f30eca9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.115381+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3584d72be01a8c606f30eca9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3584d72be01a8c606f30eca9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That's awesome! What is his name?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-5fdaff70653c4b37e5309b87", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.131631+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5fdaff70653c4b37e5309b87", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5fdaff70653c4b37e5309b87", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: I named him Buddy because he's my buddy and I hope him and Toby become buddies!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-73aa04e9d688a95b986add3f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.135638+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "73aa04e9d688a95b986add3f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "73aa04e9d688a95b986add3f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That's perfect! Sounds like Buddy really is your sidekick. Do you have any favorite activities you two like to do together?"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-360c4d4f0830311118c5bafc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.151392+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "360c4d4f0830311118c5bafc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "360c4d4f0830311118c5bafc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Yeah, Buddy and I have a great time doing walks. It's a nice way to spend time together and get some fresh air."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-5cac2ff9b2f5cd44c18b9c61", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.163150+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5cac2ff9b2f5cd44c18b9c61", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5cac2ff9b2f5cd44c18b9c61", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Nice! Buddy seems to be having a great time! It's nice to spend time together and get some fresh air."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-bd692e553212899ea247281c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.174952+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd692e553212899ea247281c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd692e553212899ea247281c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Yep, he loves checking out new hiking trails with us. It's awesome to see him so stoked and interested in everything nature has to offer."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-5d539a53193775aece4429ec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.174952+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5d539a53193775aece4429ec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5d539a53193775aece4429ec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That sounds awesome! Have fun exploring the trails!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-4f3531b778eb7415b985b51e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.198401+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4f3531b778eb7415b985b51e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4f3531b778eb7415b985b51e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Yup! I will be taking both of them to the trails together soon!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-7f54b9770f6c7a83cbec7655", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.208158+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7f54b9770f6c7a83cbec7655", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7f54b9770f6c7a83cbec7655", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: I can't wait for our hike with the furry friends next month - it's gonna be awesome!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-b70fd8a69583a213b7cc5b28", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.218675+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b70fd8a69583a213b7cc5b28", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b70fd8a69583a213b7cc5b28", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Oh yeah! It going to be fun with the new addition."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-0abf8e1c400748050d3071f4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.228190+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0abf8e1c400748050d3071f4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0abf8e1c400748050d3071f4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Ooo where is this gorgeous spot? I need to take my pups for a stroll there."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-612669e83db3f1d58c77274b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.237944+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "612669e83db3f1d58c77274b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "612669e83db3f1d58c77274b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Haha is nowhere near the city. Wish I could take them to a place like this, far from the city."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-80caf1d28fe75e013d3999bb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.247959+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "80caf1d28fe75e013d3999bb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "80caf1d28fe75e013d3999bb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: That sounds like a great getaway from the city tho! I'm hoping we can find something just as nice for our hike."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-acb7784b85300afa80d161ba", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.257714+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "acb7784b85300afa80d161ba", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "acb7784b85300afa80d161ba", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Well if that's what you want, then let's find something just as nice for our hike."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-003c9ff79f209e0c9bc2c400", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.267729+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "003c9ff79f209e0c9bc2c400", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "003c9ff79f209e0c9bc2c400", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: Yep! I'll do some research and see if I can find an awesome place like that."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-e79e9946765a7997400b0de8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.277484+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e79e9946765a7997400b0de8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e79e9946765a7997400b0de8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Awesome! I really appreciate your effort! Let's see if there's somewhere like that."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-0934b2592d85224b70f36125", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.287244+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0934b2592d85224b70f36125", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0934b2592d85224b70f36125", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Audrey: You just wait. I'm gonna find the best spot for the hike. Haha."}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-efc916197f55e014d16460b6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.296304+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "efc916197f55e014d16460b6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "efc916197f55e014d16460b6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Andrew: Haha, I can't wait!"}, "creation_event": "campaign-ingest-3.3-DATASET-FULL-2026-09-07-locomo-conv-44/session_24-0306c89ba0fad4fc5960c65d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-07T10:57:23.304982+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0306c89ba0fad4fc5960c65d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0306c89ba0fad4fc5960c65d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
